    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Losing even a few kilos takes a lot of load off the hip. Keep walking in short regular bursts and use a stick in the opposite hand. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency.",
